        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>40 篇短文背完 3500 词 — 一. Mark and a Seal 马克和海豹</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 14px 26px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  h2.section {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #2f7fd1;\n    margin: 22px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  h2.section .cn {\n    color: #2f7fd1;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  /* red highlighted English words */\n  .r { color: #e8262b; }\n  /* Chinese gloss lines under the English lines */\n  .gloss {\n    color: #e8262b;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 1px 0 7px 0;\n    white-space: pre;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .line {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .num {\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .num.red { color: #e8262b; }\n  em.it { font-style: italic; }\n  /* faint diagonal watermark seen across the middle of the page */\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 340px;\n    left: 150px;\n    transform: rotate(-30deg);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.07);\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">40 篇短文背完 3500 词</h1>\n\n  <h2 class=\"section\">一． Mark and a Seal <span class=\"cn\">马克和海豹</span></h2>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">[Watermark: illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"body-text\">\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"num\">❶</span>Mark <span class=\"r\">rented</span> an <span class=\"r\">accommodation</span> with his <span class=\"r\">pension near</span> the <span class=\"r\">shore</span>. He paid</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">        租借              住处                  养老金 在…旁边 海岸</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">annual visits</span> there to <span class=\"r\">enjoy</span> the <span class=\"r\">vivid beauty</span> in the <span class=\"r\">depths</span> of the <span class=\"r\">pure</span> sea.</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">每年的 访问              享受      生动的 美丽          深处          纯净的</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"num red\">❷</span><span class=\"r\">Once</span>, with his <span class=\"r\">underwater telescope</span> and <span class=\"r\">flashlight</span>. Mark <span class=\"r\">dived along</span> the</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">有一次        水下  望远镜        手电筒        潜水  沿着</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">boundary between</span> the <span class=\"r\">steep reef</span> and the <span class=\"r\">area</span> of <span class=\"r\">seaweed conservation</span>.</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">分界线    在…之间      陡峭的 暗礁        地区      海草      保护区</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">Suddenly</span> an <span class=\"r\">awesome</span> Antarctic <span class=\"r\">seal</span> with <span class=\"r\">sharp teeth appeared opposite</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">突然        令人惊叹的 南极的    海豹        锋利的牙齿   出现   在…对面</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">him. Every <span class=\"r\">cell</span> in his <span class=\"r\">body</span> was scared to death. <span class=\"r\">But</span> soon, he was <span class=\"r\">aware</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">              细胞      身体      被吓到          但是        察觉到</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">that he wasn't the <span class=\"r\">target</span> of an <span class=\"r\">attack</span>. With a neat wound in its <span class=\"r\">lip</span> caused</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">                    目标          袭击          整齐的伤口   嘴唇  造成</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">by <em class=\"it\">a shark</em>, this <span class=\"r\">grey seal</span> was <span class=\"r\">washed upside down</span> by the <span class=\"r\">tides time after</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">    鲨鱼        灰色的海豹      被冲刷  头上  脚下        潮水 时不时地</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">time</span>. But it <span class=\"r\">tried</span> to jog Mark <span class=\"r\">as if</span> to urge him to <span class=\"r\">help</span> it. So Mark <span class=\"r\">abandoned</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">        努力  轻轻碰撞      好像  催促    帮助              放弃</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">fleeing</span> away. With its <span class=\"r\">teamwork</span>, Mark used a <span class=\"r\">net</span> to drag the <span class=\"r\">seal</span> to the</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">逃跑            团队合作        用    网    拖    海豹</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">shallow water</span>. Without pausing he <span class=\"r\">helped it out</span> after a simple operation</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">浅水区        毫不停歇地  帮助它解决问题        简单的手术</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">and <span class=\"r\">settled</span> it in a narrow cave by the <span class=\"r\">seaside</span>. <span class=\"r\">Every time</span> he brought it <span class=\"r\">tasty</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">    安顿        狭窄的山洞          海边      每次            美味的</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\">fish it would <span class=\"r\">yell</span> and <span class=\"r\">suck</span> his hands <span class=\"r\">happily</span>. <span class=\"r\">Witnesses</span> said their <span class=\"r\">anecdotes</span></p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">              叫唤      吮吸          开心地      目击者        他们的 轶事</div>\n\n    <p class=\"line\"><span class=\"r\">reflected</span> a magic <span class=\"r\">dimension</span> of the <span class=\"r\">relationship</span> between <span class=\"r\">humans</span> and <span class=\"r\">animals</span>.</p>\n    <div class=\"gloss\">映射      奇妙的方面          关系              人与 动物</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
